#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>there are still bells before the dawn<else>night will fall anew</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
